[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0251","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0251.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0280","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 6/7 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 6/7 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含超长 Location URL 的恶意链接，当用户点击该链接时触发缓冲区溢出，导致 RealPlayer 客户端崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 6 和 7 版本，攻击条件简单，无需身份认证，但 CVSS 评分仅 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0280"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:23.237","remediation":"建议立即将 RealNetworks RealPlayer 升级至 8.0 及以上版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已被修复。如无法升级，可考虑卸载 RealPlayer 并改用其他播放器作为临时缓解措施。由于该版本已停止安全支持，建议彻底移除该软件以避免其他已知漏洞风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0018.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1088","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19834","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0280.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0280","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0280.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0280.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vww3-jfqj-592j/GHSA-vww3-jfqj-592j.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0280.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0a6cb3c3-0f7e-4531-b9f0-ed2f524b9454.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0251.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0251.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0251.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0286","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0286.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0296","title":"fcheck 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"fcheck 是一款用于文件完整性检查的工具，其处理文件名时存在安全缺陷，未对用户可控的文件名中的 shell 元字符（如反引号、分号、管道符等）进行有效过滤和转义。本地攻击者可通过创建含有恶意 shell 元字符的特制文件名，诱使 fcheck 在处理文件时将其传递给 shell 执行，从而以 fcheck 运行权限执行任意命令，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限并能够在受影响目录中创建文件才能利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0296"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-31T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:25.290","remediation":"升级 fcheck 至 2.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复文件名 shell 元字符转义问题；若无法升级，建议在 fcheck 源码中调用系统命令前对文件名使用 escapeshellarg() 或等价的 POSIX shell 转义函数处理所有文件名字段。临时缓解措施：限制被监控目录的写入权限，确保不可信用户无法在 fcheck 扫描路径下创建文件，同时考虑迁移至 AIDE、Tripwire 或 Samhain 等仍在维护的文件完整性检查工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/current/0011.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1086","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0296.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0296.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0296","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0296.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b