ite 包：`pkg_delete orville-write`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1263","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1070","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0235.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0235","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0235.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0235.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-mp4x-527r-p76p/GHSA-mp4x-527r-p76p.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--19dee80f-ec0a-48ce-9ec6-953e7f8f02e6.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0235.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0213.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0268","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0268.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0281","title":"Napster Napster Client 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Napster 客户端 beta 5 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标 Napster 客户端发送超长消息触发缓冲区溢出，导致客户端进程崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Napster 客户端 beta 5 版本，攻击难度低，无需身份认证即可远程利用。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，建议用户升级至更高版本避免风险。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0281"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:23.380","remediation":"Napster 客户端 beta 5 已于 2001 年随 Napster 服务关闭而停止维护，官方未发布任何安全补丁。建议立即停止使用 Napster 客户端 beta 5，卸载该软件并迁移至其他现代音乐流媒体服务。如因兼容性原因必须使用，应在防火墙或主机层面限制该程序的出站网络连接，阻止其接收外部消息以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0277.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0299.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0281.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0281","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0281.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0281.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3rjm-jwr3-fh58/GHSA-3rjm-jwr3-fh58.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88320/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0281.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--78c86117-d133-4634-a97d-d71577e13858.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f9648a93cda37545740a15294a2d605e6f32fa20/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0268.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0221","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0221.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0243","title":"AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 1.0.3 HTTP 服务器存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 /cgi-bin 路径发送特制的短 GET 请求，触发服务器处理异常导致服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 1.0.3 版本，攻击无需身份认证，危害等级中等。受影响用户应升级至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0243"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-25T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:18.377","remediation":"升级到 AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 1.1 或更高版本。该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至活跃维护的 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）。若无法升级，在防火墙或反向代理层过滤对 /cgi-bin 的异常短请求，并仅允许可信 IP 访问服务器 80 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/sswww.htm","http://www.osvdb.org/1265","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1076","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=web-5645555%40post2.rnci.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4189","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19820","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0243.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0243","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0243.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0243.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-552v-34vx-qhgq/GHSA-552v-34vx-qhgq.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/analogx.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c3440